WEBVTT

00:07.827 --> 00:09.103
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.172 --> 00:10.793
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.862 --> 00:12.275
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.344 --> 00:14.241
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.310 --> 00:17.275
- ♪ Ohh... ♪
- ♪ 哦...♪

00:17.344 --> 00:19.379
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:19.448 --> 00:21.379
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.448 --> 00:23.275
- ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:23.344 --> 00:24.965
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.034 --> 00:27.413
- ♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:27.482 --> 00:29.206
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.275 --> 00:31.413
- ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
- ♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.482 --> 00:33.379
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.448 --> 00:35.241
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.310 --> 00:37.379
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.448 --> 00:39.482
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.551 --> 00:40.827
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.896 --> 00:42.689
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.758 --> 00:45.241
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.310 --> 00:47.724
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

00:47.793 --> 00:49.344
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:49.827 --> 00:53.379
[cheerful music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:53.448 --> 01:00.517
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

01:01.931 --> 01:05.310
both: Five, four, three,
两者：五、四、三、

01:05.379 --> 01:07.758
two, one!
二，一！

01:07.827 --> 01:08.793
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

01:08.862 --> 01:10.241
- Ah!
- 啊！

01:11.310 --> 01:13.689
- You know, it's remarkable
how chum goes bad
- 你知道，这很了不起
密友怎么变坏的

01:13.758 --> 01:15.448
every week right on time.
每周准时。

01:15.517 --> 01:17.827
- Yeah, just like
your underpants.
- 是的，就像
你的内裤。

01:17.896 --> 01:19.068
- What?
- 什么？

01:19.137 --> 01:21.068
They're good for another month.
他们还能再用一个月。

01:21.137 --> 01:22.793
Heh. Heh, heh.
呵呵。呵呵。

01:22.862 --> 01:24.241
[wolf whistle]
[狼哨]

01:24.310 --> 01:26.172
- Now go and get rid
of that chum
- 现在去摆脱吧
那个密友的

01:26.241 --> 01:29.896
before the Health Inspector
gives us a fine.
在卫生督察面前
给我们罚款。

01:29.965 --> 01:31.758
And don't play with it!
并且不要玩它！

01:31.827 --> 01:35.793
- [laughing] But it makes
a funny sound!
- [笑]但这使得
一个有趣的声音！

01:35.862 --> 01:37.068
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

01:37.137 --> 01:39.482
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

01:39.551 --> 01:41.379
- [belches]
- [yelling]
- [打嗝]
- [大喊]

01:41.448 --> 01:43.586
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

01:45.448 --> 01:48.724
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

01:48.793 --> 01:50.827
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

01:50.896 --> 01:53.241
[grunts, mumbling]
[咕哝，咕哝]

01:53.310 --> 01:56.000
Hm. No chum dumping.
嗯。没有密友倾倒。

01:56.068 --> 01:59.000
$1 billion fine.
罚款10亿美元。

01:59.068 --> 02:01.896
Eat chum, sign! Yah!
吃密友，签名！啊！

02:01.965 --> 02:03.793
[laughing]
[笑]

02:03.862 --> 02:07.172
Ha-ha!
[chuckles]
哈哈！
[笑声]

02:07.241 --> 02:10.586
[straining]
[紧张]

02:10.655 --> 02:13.517
Eugene H. Krabs!
尤金·克拉布斯！

02:13.586 --> 02:14.724
[thud]
[砰]

02:14.793 --> 02:18.068
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:18.137 --> 02:19.758
I guess I've used
this sewer hole
我想我已经用过
这个下水道洞

02:19.827 --> 02:21.413
one too many times.
一次太多了。

02:21.482 --> 02:23.103
[mumbling]
[咕哝]

02:23.172 --> 02:25.862
[grunting, yelling]
[咕哝，大喊]

02:25.931 --> 02:27.827
[sighs] Hm.
[叹气] 嗯。

02:27.896 --> 02:30.758
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

02:30.827 --> 02:32.172
[babbling]
[胡说]

02:32.241 --> 02:33.413
Those evil painting lessons
那些邪恶的绘画课

02:33.482 --> 02:35.448
I took really come in handy.
我拿的确实派上用场了。

02:35.517 --> 02:38.034
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

02:38.103 --> 02:41.103
- And so I said to Andy
that, uh--
- 所以我对安迪说
那个，呃——

02:41.172 --> 02:44.068
Yeah, Larry. I'm gonna have
to call you back.
是的，拉里。我将会有
给你回电。

02:44.137 --> 02:45.517
[dial tone]
[拨号音]

02:45.586 --> 02:48.034
- Oh, yeah,
the old wishing well.
- 哦，是的，
老许愿井。

02:48.103 --> 02:50.482
I'll just dump some chum
in here.
我会甩掉一些朋友
在这里。

02:50.551 --> 02:52.758
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:52.827 --> 02:55.103
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

02:56.931 --> 02:58.655
Huh?
啊？

02:58.724 --> 03:00.413
[pop, sizzling]
[噗噗噗噗]

03:00.482 --> 03:03.275
Guess I've gone to this well
once too often.
我想我已经去过这口井了
一次太频繁了。

03:03.344 --> 03:05.241
[gasps] Wait, I know!
[喘气]等等，我知道！

03:05.310 --> 03:09.034
Ee! I wish this well
was empty of chum.
诶！我祝愿这一切顺利
没有朋友了。

03:09.103 --> 03:10.758
Geee! Ha!
哎呀！哈!

03:14.896 --> 03:16.724
Lousy rip off.
糟糕的撕毁。

03:18.344 --> 03:20.896
[wheels creaking]
[车轮吱吱作响]

03:20.965 --> 03:24.172
[shimmering chimes]
[闪烁的钟声]

03:28.103 --> 03:29.896
- Huh? Hm.
- 啊？嗯。

03:29.965 --> 03:31.517
And I'm back.
我回来了。

03:31.586 --> 03:34.206
[snails meowing]
[蜗牛喵喵叫]

03:34.275 --> 03:36.379
- Oh.
[meowing continues]
- 哦。
[喵喵声继续]

03:36.448 --> 03:38.413
[grunts]
[咕哝]

03:38.482 --> 03:40.206
- Hm.
- [meows]
- 嗯。
- [喵]

03:40.275 --> 03:42.689
- [laughing]
- [笑]

03:42.758 --> 03:45.758
Whoa-whoa-whoa!
[laughing]
哇-哇-哇！
[笑]

03:45.827 --> 03:47.655
Whoo! [laughs] Whoo!
呼！ [笑] 哇！

03:47.724 --> 03:50.689
[laughing, wailing]
[笑声、哀号]

03:52.137 --> 03:55.586
That was unbelievable!
太难以置信了！

03:55.655 --> 03:58.068
Wait a minute.
What is this? Chum?
等一下。
这是什么？密友？

03:58.137 --> 03:59.931
- No, of course not.
- 不，当然不是。

04:00.000 --> 04:02.413
It's...it's, uh, a gift!
这是……呃，礼物！

04:02.482 --> 04:05.827
- A gift? For who?
- 礼物？为了谁？

04:05.896 --> 04:08.000
- For you. For everyone.
- 为你。对于每个人来说。

04:08.068 --> 04:09.931
- Sure looks like chum.
- 当然看起来像密友。

04:10.000 --> 04:11.758
[peaceful music]
[平静的音乐]

04:11.827 --> 04:16.482
- It's new chum.
It's delicious.
- 这是新朋友。
很好吃。

04:16.551 --> 04:17.517
[gags]
[笑点]

04:17.586 --> 04:20.206
- New chum?
Ooh, let me try.
- 新朋友？
哦，让我试试。

04:20.275 --> 04:21.413
- No!
- 不！

04:21.482 --> 04:23.517
Uh, you have to wait.
呃，你必须等待。

04:23.586 --> 04:26.000
For, uh, like a holiday.
呃，就像一个假期。

04:26.068 --> 04:27.862
- Holiday?
What holiday?
- 假期？
什么节日？

04:27.931 --> 04:29.310
- Um.
- 嗯。

04:29.379 --> 04:31.896
Chum Day...?
密友日...？

04:31.965 --> 04:35.137
- Chum Day.
Tell me about Chum Day.
- 密友日。
告诉我关于密友日的事。

04:35.206 --> 04:37.172
What's it like?
What do you do?
它是什么样的？
你做什么工作？

04:37.241 --> 04:38.827
- I'll tell you all about it
- 我会告诉你一切

04:38.896 --> 04:41.172
if you help me hide
all these gifts.
如果你帮我隐藏
所有这些礼物。

04:41.241 --> 04:43.724
- Oh, boy!
Chum Day.
- 哦，孩子！
密友日。

04:43.793 --> 04:45.931
A brand new holiday!
一个全新的假期！

04:46.000 --> 04:47.551
Okay, Gary.
You can go home.
好的，加里。
你可以回家了。

04:47.620 --> 04:49.172
- [meows]
- [喵]

04:51.344 --> 04:53.344
[car door shuts, engine revvs]
[车门关闭，发动机转速]

04:53.413 --> 04:56.000
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

04:56.068 --> 04:58.413
- Was that his car?
- No.
- 那是他的车吗？
- 不。

04:59.689 --> 05:03.000
Ooh, and does it snow chum
on Chum Day?
哦，下雪了吗朋友
在密友日？

05:03.068 --> 05:04.793
[giggling]
- Uh, sure.
[咯咯笑]
- 呃，当然。

05:04.862 --> 05:07.241
- Do the kids make chum men?
What about icicles?
- 孩子们会成为好朋友吗？
冰柱呢？

05:07.310 --> 05:10.172
Do you call them [giggles]
Chum-cicles?
你管他们叫吗[咯咯笑]
密友？

05:10.241 --> 05:11.793
- Yeah, whatever.
- 是的，无论如何。

05:11.862 --> 05:13.931
Wait a minute.
This is Krabs' house.
等一下。
这是蟹老板的家。

05:14.000 --> 05:16.517
- Uh-huh. I thought we could
hide his chum gifts inside
- 呃哈。我以为我们可以
将他的密友礼物藏在里面

05:16.586 --> 05:19.310
by pumping them
through the window.
通过泵送它们
透过窗户。

05:19.379 --> 05:21.344
Oh, darn, the window's closed.
哦，该死，窗户关着。

05:21.413 --> 05:22.896
- Hey, what's that?
- 嘿，那是什么？

05:22.965 --> 05:24.517
[laser blast]
[激光爆炸]

05:24.586 --> 05:26.793
The window's open.
- Yay!
窗户开着。
- 耶！

05:26.862 --> 05:28.517
[grunting excitedly]
[兴奋地咕哝]

05:28.586 --> 05:30.965
[chum spurting, oozing]
[口水喷出，渗出]

05:31.034 --> 05:32.275
[footsteps approaching]
[脚步声逼近]

05:32.344 --> 05:35.310
- [yawns]
Who's there?
- [哈欠]
谁在那里？

05:35.379 --> 05:36.896
Wha--[groans]
什——[呻吟]

05:36.965 --> 05:38.931
["Dance of
the Sugar Plum Fairy"]
[“舞蹈
糖梅仙子”]

05:39.000 --> 05:40.379
[snoring]
- Aw.
[打鼾]
- 噢。

05:40.448 --> 05:42.000
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

05:42.068 --> 05:43.724
Shh.
嘘。

05:45.068 --> 05:48.517
[muttering] I bet he has
visions of sugar chums
[嘀咕]我打赌他有
糖友的愿景

05:48.586 --> 05:51.206
dancing in his head.
[giggles]
在他的脑海中跳舞。
[咯咯笑]

05:51.275 --> 05:53.034
- Let's keep moving.
- 让我们继续前进吧。

05:53.103 --> 05:55.413
[bright orchestra music]
[明亮的管弦乐]

05:55.482 --> 05:56.931
- [giggling]
- [咯咯笑]

05:57.000 --> 05:58.137
- [gurgling]
- [咯咯声]

05:58.206 --> 05:59.620
[chum spurts]
[密友喷涌]

06:07.655 --> 06:10.896
- [muttering merrily]
- [愉快地嘀咕]

06:13.241 --> 06:15.862
[TV playing]
[电视播放]

06:17.655 --> 06:20.137
[muffled gasp, screaming]
[低沉的喘息，尖叫]

06:20.206 --> 06:23.034
- And we'll drink chum-nog and
sing around the chum-chum tree
- 我们会喝浓酒
围着 chum-chum 树唱歌

06:23.103 --> 06:26.172
and there'll be colorful
chum lights all over town.
and there'll be colorful
镇上到处都是密友灯。

06:26.241 --> 06:29.275
- Yes. That'd be good.
Heh heh.
- 是的。那就好了。
呵呵。

06:29.344 --> 06:30.689
[hollow thudding]
[空洞的撞击声]

06:30.758 --> 06:33.655
Sounds like there's
only one scoop left.
听起来好像有
只剩一勺了。

06:33.724 --> 06:35.482
- Ooh, that one's for you!
- 哦，那个是给你的！

06:35.551 --> 06:37.310
Let me hide it.
I want to hide it!
让我把它隐藏起来。
我想隐藏它！

06:37.379 --> 06:39.310
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

06:40.241 --> 06:41.793
[grunts]
[咕哝]

06:41.862 --> 06:45.241
- Okay now, go home so you
don't see where I hide it.
- 好吧，现在回家吧
没看到我把它藏在哪里了。

06:45.310 --> 06:48.758
- Oh, no, I wouldn't want
to see that.
- Oh, no, I wouldn't want
看到那个。

06:48.827 --> 06:51.000
What a numbskull.
真是个笨蛋。

06:55.689 --> 06:58.034
- [singsongy] No peeking!
- [singsongy] 不准偷看！

06:58.103 --> 07:01.517
- Well, Plankton, you got rid
of it all.
- 好吧，浮游生物，你摆脱了
这一切。

07:01.586 --> 07:03.965
And with no chum-uppance.
而且没有任何好感。

07:04.034 --> 07:05.896
[chuckles] Whoa.
[笑]哇哦。

07:08.413 --> 07:11.379
[laughing]
[笑]

07:12.586 --> 07:14.724
- [yawns] What time is it?
- [哈欠] 现在几点了？

07:14.793 --> 07:17.172
I guess I should hide
Plankton's Chum Day gift
我想我应该躲起来
浮游生物的密友日礼物

07:17.241 --> 07:19.034
before Chum Day's all over.
在密友日结束之前。

07:19.103 --> 07:23.724
Aha! I bet Plankton would never
think to look in the sewer.
啊哈！我打赌浮游生物永远不会
想着去下水道里看看。

07:23.793 --> 07:25.103
[grunts]
[咕哝]

07:25.172 --> 07:27.655
Oh. Chum. Oh, well.
哦。密友。那好吧。

07:27.724 --> 07:30.000
Maybe I can get
a little more in there.
也许我能得到
那里还有一点。

07:30.068 --> 07:31.310
Hm?
嗯？

07:31.379 --> 07:33.896
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

07:38.379 --> 07:39.413
[chuckles]
[笑声]

07:39.482 --> 07:42.068
[rumbling]
[隆隆声]

07:43.758 --> 07:46.517
[bright music, bells ringing]
【欢快的音乐，铃声响起】

07:46.586 --> 07:49.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

07:49.275 --> 07:51.896
- Caution wet chum!
- 小心湿朋友！

07:53.172 --> 07:55.586
[wailing] Whoa-whoa-whoa!
[哀嚎] 哇哇哇！

07:55.655 --> 07:57.413
Slippery when chum?
亲密时滑吗？

07:57.482 --> 07:58.931
- Mmm, nummy!
- 嗯，笨蛋！

07:59.000 --> 08:02.275
- Don't eat chum
off the sidewalk. Bah!
- 不要吃密友
离开人行道。呸!

08:02.344 --> 08:04.551
- There's chum here!
- Ew!
- 这里有密友！
- 呃！

08:04.620 --> 08:06.758
[chattering angrily]
[愤怒地喋喋不休]

08:06.827 --> 08:09.103
- What's with all the chum?
- Call my lawyer!
- 那些密友怎么了？
- 打电话给我的律师！

08:09.172 --> 08:11.551
- [straining]
- [紧张]

08:11.620 --> 08:14.551
What has that yellow idiot
done?
那个黄色白痴有什么
完成了吗？

08:14.620 --> 08:16.172
[chattering angrily]
[愤怒地喋喋不休]

08:16.241 --> 08:17.620
- Our homes have been ruined
- 我们的家园被毁了

08:17.689 --> 08:20.413
by you and your stinking chum!
你和你的臭朋友！

08:20.482 --> 08:22.793
- Your chum ruined my hair!
- 你的朋友毁了我的头发！

08:22.862 --> 08:25.344
- Your chum made me dumb!
- 你的密友让我变得愚蠢！

08:25.413 --> 08:27.103
- You were already dumb.
- 你已经很蠢了。

08:27.172 --> 08:30.137
- Well, it didn't make me
any smarter!
- 好吧，这并没有让我
任何更聪明的！

08:30.206 --> 08:31.965
- Get him!
all: Yeah!
- 抓住他！
全体：是啊！

08:32.034 --> 08:33.310
- [yelps]
- [尖叫声]

08:33.379 --> 08:35.000
[groans]
[bell rings]
[呻吟]
[铃声响起]

08:35.068 --> 08:37.241
[chorus sings "chum" to tune
of "Carol of the Bells"]
[合唱团唱“chum”来调音
出自《钟声颂歌》]

08:37.310 --> 08:39.551
♪ Chum, chum, chum, chum,
chum-chum-chum-chum ♪
♪ 密友，密友，密友，密友，
嗯嗯嗯嗯♪

08:39.620 --> 08:41.413
[light, twinkling music]
[轻快、闪烁的音乐]

08:41.482 --> 08:43.206
- We shouldn't be fighting.
- 我们不应该吵架。

08:43.275 --> 08:44.620
It's Chum Day.
今天是密友日。

08:44.689 --> 08:47.103
- Chum Day?
- What's Chum Day?
- 密友日？
- 什么是密友日？

08:47.172 --> 08:49.344
- ♪ Deck the sea with lumps
of new chum ♪
- ♪ 用块状物装饰大海
新朋友的 ♪

08:49.413 --> 08:51.724
♪ Chuma chuma chum,
chum chum chum chum ♪
♪ 楚玛楚玛楚姆，
嗯嗯嗯嗯♪

08:51.793 --> 08:53.862
♪ 'Tis the season
to be chum dumb ♪
♪ 现在是季节
做个傻瓜♪

08:53.931 --> 08:55.965
♪ Chuma chuma chum,
chum chum chum chum ♪
♪ 楚玛楚玛楚姆，
嗯嗯嗯嗯♪

08:56.034 --> 08:58.103
♪ Don we now our chum apparel ♪
♪ 我们现在穿我们的好朋友的衣服 ♪

08:58.172 --> 09:00.551
♪ Chuma chuma chum,
chum chum chum chum ♪
♪ 楚玛楚玛楚姆，
嗯嗯嗯嗯♪

09:00.620 --> 09:02.827
♪ As we sing
this stinky carol ♪
♪ 当我们歌唱时
这臭颂歌♪

09:02.896 --> 09:05.137
♪ Chuma chuma chum,
chum chum chum chum ♪
♪ 楚玛楚玛楚姆，
嗯嗯嗯嗯♪

09:05.206 --> 09:07.862
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

09:07.931 --> 09:12.689
Chum! Chum! Chum!
Hello, I'm Chum-ta Claus.
密友！密友！密友！
你好，我是楚姆塔·克劳斯。

09:13.896 --> 09:16.620
- So anyway, back to
the mob violence.
- 无论如何，回到
暴民暴力。

09:16.689 --> 09:18.103
[all growl]
[children laugh]
[全都咆哮]
[孩子们笑]

09:18.172 --> 09:21.517
[chattering, laughter]
[闲聊、笑声]

09:21.586 --> 09:24.517
- Merry Chum Day, everyone.
- 祝大家友谊日快乐。

09:24.586 --> 09:26.275
- Huh?
- Hm?
- 啊？
- 嗯？

09:26.344 --> 09:29.310
[chattering happily]
[开心地聊天]

09:29.379 --> 09:31.827
- Strong grip, huh? Yeah.
[laughs]
- 抓地力强吧？是的。
[笑]

09:31.896 --> 09:34.758
- I officially declare today
- 我今天正式宣布

09:34.827 --> 09:36.448
Chum Day!
- [yelps]
密友日！
- [尖叫声]

09:36.517 --> 09:39.551
[all cheering]
[大家欢呼]

09:40.655 --> 09:43.655
both: [humming] Ah.
两人：[哼哼]啊。

09:46.034 --> 09:47.620
- Whoa! Yay!
- 哇！耶！

09:47.689 --> 09:50.275
- Whoo. Heh.
Tastes really bad.
- 呼。呵呵。
味道确实不好。

09:50.344 --> 09:53.551
- But the holiday spirit
is keeping us in denial.
- 但节日气氛
让我们一直在否认。

09:53.620 --> 09:55.448
- Gristle toe?
- 软骨脚趾？

09:55.517 --> 09:56.931
[alarm blares]
[警报声]

09:57.000 --> 09:59.448
- Mwah.
- [chuckles]
- 哇。
- [轻笑]

09:59.517 --> 10:01.931
- [yawns]
- [哈欠]

10:02.000 --> 10:03.275
[gasps]
[喘气]

10:04.379 --> 10:06.586
Huh? Ah. You!
啊？啊。你！

10:06.655 --> 10:09.517
Boy! What day is today?
男生！今天是什么日子？

10:09.586 --> 10:12.448
- Today?
- Such an intelligent boy.
- 今天？
- 真是个聪明的男孩。

10:12.517 --> 10:15.344
A remarkable boy.
Yes, today!
一个了不起的男孩。
是的，今天！

10:15.413 --> 10:16.689
What is today?
今天是什么日子？

10:16.758 --> 10:18.965
- Why, it's Chum Day!
- 为什么，今天是密友日！

10:19.034 --> 10:21.517
- Then I haven't missed it.
- 那我就没有错过。

10:21.586 --> 10:23.551
Wait a minute.
Chum Day?
等一下。
密友日？

10:23.620 --> 10:27.379
That's disgusting!
太恶心了！

10:27.448 --> 10:30.172
[amazed chatter]
[惊讶的喋喋不休]

10:30.241 --> 10:32.620
- You all love Chum Day?
- 你们都喜欢密友日吗？

10:32.689 --> 10:35.103
[mutters excitedly] It was me!
[兴奋地嘀咕]是我！

10:35.172 --> 10:36.862
I invented Chum Day!
我发明了密友日！

10:36.931 --> 10:40.448
Chum Day is copy-written
by me--[whimpers]
密友日是抄写的
由我——[呜咽]

10:40.517 --> 10:44.655
- Uh, excuse me, are you
responsible for all this chum?
- 呃，请问，你是吗？
对这一切负责？

10:44.724 --> 10:47.000
- Yes, that's right.
You're welcome.
- 是的，没错。
不客气。

10:47.068 --> 10:49.275
- Well,
as the Health Inspector,
- 嗯，
作为卫生督察，

10:49.344 --> 10:51.724
I've got something for you.
我有东西给你。

10:51.793 --> 10:55.448
- Hm. $1 billion!
- 嗯。 10亿美元！

10:55.517 --> 10:58.931
[whimpering] Bleh!
[呜咽] 哎呀！

10:59.000 --> 11:01.965
- You know, there is a way
out of paying the fine.
- 你知道，有一个办法
免于缴纳罚款。

11:02.034 --> 11:03.896
- I'll do it.
What is it?
- 我会做的。
它是什么？

11:03.965 --> 11:06.310
- You can eat up all the chum.
- 你可以吃掉所有的密友。

11:08.724 --> 11:10.655
- [gulps, coughing]
- [吞咽，咳嗽]

11:10.724 --> 11:15.413
Isn't there anyone that knows
the true meaning of Chum Day?
难道没有人知道吗
密友日的真正含义是什么？

11:15.482 --> 11:17.241
- I know.
- Huh?
- 我知道。
- 啊？

11:17.310 --> 11:19.551
- Lights, please.
- 请开灯。

11:19.620 --> 11:22.103
And lo, there was chum.
看哪，有密友。

11:22.172 --> 11:24.551
A food that turned
from revolting to festive
一种变身的食物
从反感到喜庆

11:24.620 --> 11:26.275
by magical thinking.
通过神奇的思维。

11:26.344 --> 11:27.551
And the goodwill of chum
还有密友的善意

11:27.620 --> 11:29.310
clogged the hearts
of fish kind
堵住了心
鱼种的

11:29.379 --> 11:31.379
and ushered in a new--
并迎来了一个新的——

11:31.448 --> 11:34.620
[laughter]
[笑声]

11:34.689 --> 11:36.586
- Several days later...
- 几天后...

11:36.655 --> 11:39.655
[laid-back music]
[悠闲的音乐]

11:39.724 --> 11:41.413
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

11:41.482 --> 11:44.310
- [mutters, groans]
- [低语，呻吟]

11:47.586 --> 11:50.172
[fatigued muttering]
[疲惫的低语]

11:51.034 --> 11:54.931
[ukulele music]
[尤克里里音乐]

11:55.000 --> 12:02.206
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

♪ ♪